ical", "chapters": ["60c9e849ea076dc381c0df8c"], "topics": ["60e2fada66f9ce3f243b476e"], "concepts": ["60e40fd4f1ef260f84ed1e57"], "question": {"text": "A system does&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>200</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi></math> of work and at the same time absorbs <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>150</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi></math> of heat. The magnitude of the change in internal energy is&nbsp; ______<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi></math>. (Nearest integer)"}, "options": [{"id": "eea02e", "text": "", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f8d2ee0e063d929bb98"}, {"id": "226dff", "text": "", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f8d2ee0e063d929bb99"}, {"id": "41b979", "text": "", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f8d2ee0e063d929bb9a"}, {"id": "fe746c", "text": "", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f8d2ee0e063d929bb9b"}], "questionLabels": []}, {"_id": "69de4f8d2ee0e063d929bb9c", "type": "numerical", "chapters": ["60c9e849ea076dc381c0df8c"], "topics": ["60e2fada66f9ce3f243b4783"], "concepts": ["60e567dc499d1e49588f9cb8"], "question": {"text": "The enthalpy of combustion of propane, graphite and dihydrogen at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>298</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></math> are: <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mn>2220</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kJ</mi><msup><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mol</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mn>393</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kJ</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>mol</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mn>285</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kJ</mi><msup><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mol</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math> respectively. The magnitude enthalpy of formation of propane <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>8</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced></math> is _____ <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>kJmol</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>. (Nearest integer)"}, "options": [{"id": "1207d1", "text": "", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f8d2ee0e063d929bb9d"}, {"id": "e85d3e", "text": "", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f8d2ee0e063d929bb9e"}, {"id": "782784", "text": "", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f8d2ee0e063d929bb9f"}, {"id": "a94aeb", "text": "", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f8d2ee0e063d929bba0"}], "questionLabels": []}], "markingScheme": {"_id": "608283c623cf4b3ad8f125e5", "title": "JEE Numerical", "correctAttempt": 4, "incorrectAttempt": -1, "createdAt": "2021-04-09T08:45:27.797Z", "updatedAt": "2021-07-05T05:39:27.056Z", "__v": 0, "updated_by": "6042252509c5bf34e8a2f178"}, "maximumAttemptLimit": 20, "linkedQuestions": [], "createdAt": "2026-04-14T14:30:37.435Z", "updatedAt": "2026-04-14T14:30:37.435Z", "__v": 0}, "position": 0, "_id": "69de4f8d2ee0e063d929bbe9"}], "bonusSections": [], "packDetails": [], "paidFeatures": [], "tags": [], "timeRestrictionSlots": [], "createdAt": "2026-04-14T11:16:06.249Z", "updatedAt": "2026-04-17T04:58:03.800Z", "testType": "PYQs as Chapter Tests", "isResumeBufferAllowed": true, "enableAccessibility": true, "maxAttemptableQuestion": 20, "analysisVideoThumbnail": "", "analysisVideoThumbnailDark": "", "shortTitle": "", "subjectDetails": [{"subjectId": "607018ee404ae53194e73d91", "title": "Chemistry", "shortName": "Chem"}], "testTimerType": "mm", "isMarkForReviewAvailable": true}, "temporaryTestDetail": {"_id": "6a4a1ec39cbf3c651305653d", "testId": "69de21f67e39d99b57bc5b5d", "userId": "6914cc9c4d7566258ee3a8fd", "startedAt": "2026-07-05T09:07:15.505Z",